{
  "key": 18191,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0512_T08_00000",
      "en_US": [
        "One of the Elite Four used to be\n",
        "the Leader of Fuchsia’s Gym."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0512_T08_00001",
      "en_US": [
        "Koga’s daughter succeeded him as\n",
        "the Gym Leader after he joined\f",
        "the Elite Four."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0512_T08_00002",
      "en_US": [
        "The Safari Zone wasn’t open\n",
        "for a while.\r",
        "Then it moved to Johto before\n",
        "I knew it.\f",
        "It’s sad...\r",
        "It was this city’s main attraction."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0512_T08_00003",
      "en_US": [
        "Fuchsia City\n",
        "Happening and Passing City"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0512_T08_00004",
      "en_US": [
        "Fuchsia City Pokémon Gym\n",
        "Leader: Janine\f",
        "The Poisonous Ninja Master"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0512_T08_00005",
      "en_US": [
        "There’s a notice here...\r",
        "The Safari Zone is closed.\f",
        "Instead, we have Pal Park."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0512_T08_00006",
      "en_US": "Home of the Pal Park Warden"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0512_T08_00007",
      "en_US": [
        "Shard de Berry!\n",
        "Shard de Berry!\r",
        "Yah, yah!\n",
        "I trade Berry for Shard.\r",
        "If ya bring me some Shards,\n",
        "I will give ya three Berries, yah!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0512_T08_00008",
      "en_US": [
        "Shard de Berry!\n",
        "Shard de Berry!\r",
        "Yah, yah!\n",
        "I trade Berry for Shard.\r",
        "If ya bring me some Shards,\n",
        "I will give ya three Berries, yah!\r",
        "Which Shard will ya trade for\n",
        "de Berry?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0512_T08_00009",
      "en_US": [
        "More Shards to trade for\n",
        "de Berries?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0512_T08_00010",
      "en_US": [
        "Yah, yah!\n",
        "Come back when ya’ve changed\f",
        "ya mind, yah!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0512_T08_00011",
      "en_US": [
        "I’ll give ya de Berry set E\n",
        "for de Red Shard, yah!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0512_T08_00012",
      "en_US": [
        "I’ll give ya de Berry set F\n",
        "for de Blue Shard, yah!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0512_T08_00013",
      "en_US": [
        "I’ll give ya de Berry set G\n",
        "for de Yellow Shard, yah!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0512_T08_00014",
      "en_US": [
        "I’ll give ya de Berry set H\n",
        "for de Green Shard, yah!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0512_T08_00015",
      "en_US": [
        "Ya already have many Berries\n",
        "of dis set.\r",
        "Come back when ya need more, yah!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0512_T08_00016",
      "en_US": "Shellder: Yerrrr!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0512_T08_00017",
      "en_US": "Cloyster: Crouu."
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0512_T08_00018",
      "en_US": [
        "Did you want to challenge the Gym\n",
        "Leader? This Shellder situation has\f",
        "caused quite a ruckus...\r",
        "Janine is probably around the city\n",
        "somewhere, trying to fix it..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0512_T08_00019",
      "en_US": [
        "The recent volcano eruption at\n",
        "Cinnabar Island caused the Pokémon of\f",
        "Seafoam Islands to get riled up.\r",
        "Now we’re swarmed with Shellder!\r",
        "Eek!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0512_T08_00020",
      "en_US": [
        "These Shellder are blocking half of\n",
        "the city’s facilities. Fuchsia may not\f",
        "be large, but this is still a humongous\f",
        "inconvenience! Argh!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0512_T08_00021",
      "en_US": "Chansey: Chans!!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0512_T08_00022",
      "en_US": "Cloyster: Neerrrr!!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0512_T08_00023",
      "en_US": "Janine: Venomoth, use Bug Buzz!\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0512_T08_00024",
      "en_US": [
        "Janine: Oh, hi! Say, you wouldn’t just\n",
        "happen to be {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, would you?\r",
        "I’ve heard about you from the other\n",
        "Kanto Gym Leaders, but you’ve picked\f",
        "a great time to arrive!\r",
        "Or bad, depending on how you see it...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0512_T08_00025",
      "en_US": [
        "Janine: We need to get rid of this\n",
        "swarm of Shellder and Cloyster!\r",
        "I reckon that if we defeat all of the\n",
        "Cloyster around town, the gangs should\f",
        "pack up and leave.\r",
        "But Nurse Joy and I are preoccupied\n",
        "with this lot... there’s more inside the\f",
        "Pal Park building, so this is going to\f",
        "take us quite a while...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0512_T08_00026",
      "en_US": [
        "Janine: Say, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, could you do me a\n",
        "favour, and try to weed out any of\f",
        "the Cloyster still hanging around the\f",
        "city, please?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0512_T08_00027",
      "en_US": [
        "Nurse Joy: Blast them with an\n",
        "Ice Beam, Chansey!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0512_T08_00028",
      "en_US": [
        "Nurse Joy: Oh, did you want to heal\n",
        "your Pokémon? I’ve been too busy\f",
        "helping out to attend the Pokémon\f",
        "Center at the moment...\r",
        "Let me heal them right here!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0512_T08_00029",
      "en_US": [
        "Please come back any time!\r",
        "Well, until the Shellder are gone..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0512_T08_00030",
      "en_US": "Janine: I swear this is endless...\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0512_T08_00031",
      "en_US": [
        "The Cloyster squared up, ready\n",
        "to have a fight!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0512_T08_00032",
      "en_US": [
        "It doesn’t look like fighting the\n",
        "Shellder did much..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0512_T08_00033",
      "en_US": [
        "The Shellder is poised, ready\n",
        "to attack!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0512_T08_00034",
      "en_US": [
        "The Shellder may have been caught,\n",
        "but another Shellder quickly took its\f",
        "spot.\r",
        "Fighting the Shellder doesn’t do\n",
        "all that much..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0512_T08_00035",
      "en_US": [
        "After a leader Cloyster was defeated,\n",
        "some of the Shellder left..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0512_T08_00036",
      "en_US": [
        "Thank you for saving me from that gang\n",
        "of Pokémon! But, I was so frightened\f",
        "that I can’t stop moving like this!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0512_T08_00037",
      "en_US": [
        "Janine: Okay, Venomoth, pump up the\n",
        "action! Silver Wind!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0512_T08_00038",
      "en_US": [
        "Janine: Whew, that should do it!\n",
        "I wonder if I handled that like\f",
        "Dad would have chosen to...\r",
        "Anyway, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, I really appreciate\n",
        "the help you gave us in sorting this\f",
        "whole situation out!\r",
        "It would be my, er.... honour, to\n",
        "battle with you for the Soul Badge!\r",
        "Of course, you don’t have to do it\n",
        "right now, technically...\r",
        "Anyway! I’ll be in the Gym.\r",
        "Don’t take too long, okay?"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
